  "summary": {"html":"<p>This joint resolution nullifies the Environmental Protection Agency notice titled <em>California State Motor Vehicle and Engine Pollution Control Standards; Advanced Clean Cars II; Waiver of Preemption; Notice of Decision</em> (90 Fed. Reg. 642) and published on January 6, 2025. Among other elements, the notice grants the California Air Resources Board request for a waiver for its Advanced Clean Cars II (ACC II) regulations. (Under the Clean Air Act, California may seek waivers of the preemption prohibiting states from enacting certain emission standards.) </p>","version":"Introduced in House","version_code":"00","version_date":"2025-04-02"},
